        ],
        "byte_range": [
          27167,
          27420
        ],
        "text_sha256": "37eeb07cb23be54075439b07f8242bd2d9c1a3464b44d08314318ade5df40269"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n宝钗—宝玉—麝月一线；凤姐—平儿一线。不要加道德裁判人。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
