        ],
        "text_sha256": "7012714ae1d9a5a829d142b19f589a9ea267499f7d2fab8e3e5a00313fe3761b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38禁补；不把“借词”写成词牌作品。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
